flowchart TD
    subgraph Safety["🛡️ Passenger Safety Architecture"]
        AR([Active Ride In Progress]) --> VC[Vehicle Verification\nCheck License Plate & Model\nPOST /rides/:id/verify-vehicle]
        VC --> VM{Plate Match?}
        VM -- ❌ MISMATCH --> VME[VEHICLE_MISMATCH Event Logged\nSafety Center Alerted]
        VM -- ✅ OK --> PIN[4-Digit Ride PIN Verification\nPOST /rides/:id/verify-pin\nRide cannot start without this]

        AR --> RD[Route Deviation Monitor\nSimulated GPS Corridor Check\nPOST /rides/:id/route-check]
        RD --> RDA{Deviation > 150m?}
        RDA -- ⚠️ Yes --> RDE[ROUTE_DEVIATION Event Logged\nPassenger Alerted]
        RDA -- ✅ No --> ROK[Route Normal]

        AR --> SC[Safety Center]
        SC --> SOS[🚨 ONE-TAP SOS\nPOST /rides/:id/sos\nSafetyEvent type=SOS logged]
        SC --> UNS[✋ I Don't Feel Safe\nSafetyEvent type=USER_UNSAFE]
        SC --> SHARE[📲 Share Live Trip\nPOST /rides/:id/share\nUnique shareToken generated\n24h expiry]
        SC --> TC[Trusted Contacts\nPARENT · FRIEND · SIBLING · OTHER\nGET/POST /trusted-contacts]

        SOS --> ALERT[Emergency Signal Broadcast\nSafety Event Persisted in DB\n⚠️ Users must call 112 in real emergencies]
        SHARE --> PUBLIC[Public Trip URL\nGET /api/shared-trip/:token\nNo auth required for tracking]
    end

    style AR fill:#EF476F,color:#fff
    style SOS fill:#EF476F,color:#fff
    style ALERT fill:#1C2541,color:#FFD166,stroke:#EF476F
    style PUBLIC fill:#1C2541,color:#06D6A0
